{"title":"OMM Elimination Exam","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>OMM Elimination Exam</b> (also known as Examen Eliminatorio) is the first of three tests of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mexican_Mathematics_Olympiad\" title=\"Mexican Mathematics Olympiad\">Mexican Mathematics Olympiad</a> at state level in Mexico.  Top scorers move on to take the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OMM_Semifinal_Exam\" title=\"OMM Semifinal Exam\">OMM Semifinal Exam</a>.\n</p>\n<table style=\"border:thin solid black;padding:10px;float:right;margin:10px;background:#fff;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;text-align:center;background:#ccf;\"><b>OMM Elimination</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Region</b>: Mexico\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Type</b>: Multiple Choice\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Competition_ratings\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Competition ratings\">Difficulty</a></b>: 1-2.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Difficulty Breakdown:</b>\n<p><u>Problem 1-10</u>: 1-1.5<br /><u>Problem 11-20</u>: 1.5-2<br /><u>Problem 21-30</u>: 2-2.5<br />Based on tests before 2016.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Structure\">Structure</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OMM_Elimination_Exam&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Structure\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The exam has 20 questions and must be finished in 4 hours.  The first five problems are 1 point, the next ten problems are 2 points, and the last five problems are 3 points.  Calculators are not allowed in the exam.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Past_Tests\">Past Tests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OMM_Elimination_Exam&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Past Tests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note: All of the problems and solutions are in Spanish.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Problems</th>\n<th>Solutions\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/eliminatorios/olimpico16.pdf\">2016 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/eliminatorios/olimpsol16.pdf\">2016 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/eliminatorios/olimpico15.pdf\">2015 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/eliminatorios/olimpsol15.pdf\">2015 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/eliminatorios/olimpico14.pdf\">2014 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/eliminatorios/olimpsol14.pdf\">2014 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/eliminatorios/olimpico13.pdf\">2013 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/eliminatorios/olimpsol13.pdf\">2013 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/eliminatorios/olimpico12.pdf\">2012 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/eliminatorios/olimpsol12.pdf\">2012 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\